  "vibe": "Deep violet-night #1d1430 over near-black #140e22, lit by gold #d4af6a and a blush #e8b4c8. Italiana's high-contrast serif runs at 0.04em tracking above Sen, and titles only drowse up 34px — nothing here slams. The world never switches off: it runs behind every beat including Statement and CTA. Five gold moon phases arc across the top, eighteen stars breathe in and out of visibility, two gold-edged tarot cards rock at the lower corners on slow sines, and a bone candle burns at the right with a flame that flickers on two frequencies at once. Cards turn by squashing flat on their own axis and reappearing; the moon reads on a full twelve-tick dial; words crossfade rather than cut. Numbers carry a gold glow. Best where patience is the product.",
